4. Files retained from the supplied original MORIZON archive

The following files in this distribution were byte-identical to files in the
supplied original archive before source headers were added where applicable:

  constants.py
  imgs/aggregate.png
  imgs/mActionArrowLeft.svg
  imgs/mActionFirst.svg
  imgs/mActionRefresh.svg
  imgs/mActionUndo.svg
  processes/printlayout/template/aggregate_template.qpt
  processes/printlayout/template/zoning_template.qpt
  processes/raster_styler/aggregate.py
  processes/raster_styler/savearea.py
  processes/raster_styler/slope.py
  processes/raster_styler/zoning.py
  processes/raster_writer/utils.py

Package initializer files also retain original structure, with licensing and
attribution headers added for this distribution.

The mAction SVG files appear to be QGIS-style action icons and are preserved
from the official MORIZON package. Their upstream provenance is not stated in
that package. They are therefore identified here rather than represented as
new MORIZON Reloaded artwork.

